# Nested class: class declared inside a namespace dict.
# Phase 1b must find Container.Sized inside the namespace,
# extract 'size' as a method name, and inject it as EffectPerform.
# The unicode instance key (ɪɴꜱᴛᴀɴᴄᴇ⧼...⧽) in output is the internal
# naming convention for instance bindings (small caps + math brackets).
[
  Container: [
    Sized: [class [let c]
      size: []]
  ]
  [instance Container.Sized
    [let c@String]: [size: [fn [let s] [str-length s]]]]
  result: [size "hello"]
]
=== out
["Container": ["Sized": []]  "ɪɴꜱᴛᴀɴᴄᴇ⧼Sized∷size⟨String⟩⧽": [fn [let s] ...]  "result": 5]
